# DAY 1 OPENER, BUILD STAND-IN (SHORTCUTS #14). John 12 Nov 22:40: "ranch, i can buy the first radar".
# The Cartel Ranch appears on the Geoscape about an hour into a new game, on the Rio Grande, and stays
# up for 30 days. STORY owns the real opener (Hawk's briefing, the lead chain); when theirs loads,
# delete this file.
#
# North America's mission zones are the stock six, copied unchanged, plus zone 6 for the ranch.
# OXCE replaces a region's missionZones whole, so all six have to be restated here.
